# Knobs at their limits on a loud sweep: P1 0 with full resonance, then P1 255 / P2 255, then dry only (pan 0).
tempo 120
steps 24
tail 0.2
track fx1
input sweep 30 16000 0.95
preset 0 95 0 0 255 0 0 0 255 255 128 255 0 0 0 0 0 0
param p1 255 8
param p2 255 8
param pan 0 16
gain 1
note 4 C1 2
note 12 G9 2
expect sound 0 24
expect peak_below 0
